#: ../../components/strategies.md:1
msgid "OptimizationStrategy"
msgstr "OptimizationStrategy"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:3
msgid ""
"`saealib` delegates the decision of which candidate solutions receive an "
"expensive true evaluation to `OptimizationStrategy`, a swappable "
"component. `step()` executes one generation's \"generate, score, "
"evaluate, update.\""
msgstr ""
"`saealib`は、どの候補解に高コストな真の評価を割り当てるかという判断を、`OptimizationStrategy`という差し替え可能なコンポーネントに委ねています。"
" `step()`が1世代分の「生成、スコアリング、評価、更新」を実行します。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:6
msgid "OptimizationStrategy's role"
msgstr "OptimizationStrategyの役割"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:8
msgid ""
"`OptimizationStrategy` requires `build_pipeline(provider) -> Pipeline` to"
" be implemented. Its `step(ctx, provider) -> OptimizationState` method "
"executes that pipeline and returns the updated state."
msgstr "`OptimizationStrategy`は`build_pipeline(provider) -> Pipeline`の実装を要求します。`step(ctx, provider) -> OptimizationState`メソッドがそのパイプラインを実行し、更新後の状態を返します。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:11
msgid ""
"The class attribute `requires_surrogate: bool` indicates whether this "
"strategy needs a `SurrogateManager`. `Optimizer.validate()` checks this "
"attribute to confirm you aren't trying to use a strategy with "
"`requires_surrogate=True` while `surrogate_manager` is unset."
msgstr ""
"クラス属性`requires_surrogate: bool`は、この戦略が`SurrogateManager`を必要とするかを示します。 "
"`Optimizer.validate()`がこの属性を見て、`surrogate_manager`が未設定のまま`requires_surrogate=True`の戦略を使おうとしていないかを確認します。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:14
msgid "Built-in Strategies"
msgstr "組み込みStrategy"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Approach"
msgstr "方式"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`DirectStrategy`"
msgstr "`DirectStrategy`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Uses no surrogate; truly evaluates every generated candidate"
msgstr "サロゲートを使わず、生成した候補を全件真に評価する"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`SteadyStateStrategy`"
msgstr "`SteadyStateStrategy`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Generates one candidate per step and supports asynchronous refill"
msgstr "1ステップにつき1候補を生成し、非同期補充に対応する"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`IndividualBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`evaluation_ratio: float = 0.1`"
msgstr "`evaluation_ratio: float = 0.1`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Scores every candidate with the surrogate, and truly evaluates only the "
"top `evaluation_ratio` fraction"
msgstr "全候補をサロゲートでスコアリングし、上位`evaluation_ratio`の割合だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`PreSelectionStrategy`"
msgstr "`PreSelectionStrategy`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`n_candidates: int, n_select: int` (both required)"
msgstr "`n_candidates: int, n_select: int`（共に必須）"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Generates `n_candidates`, scores them, and truly evaluates only the top "
"`n_select`"
msgstr "`n_candidates`件を生成してスコアリングし、上位`n_select`件だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"
msgstr "`GenerationBasedStrategy`"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "`gen_ctrl: int` (required)"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl: int`（必須）"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"Advances `gen_ctrl` generations using only the surrogate, then truly "
"evaluates a single generation"
msgstr "`gen_ctrl`世代分をサロゲートのみで進め、その後1世代だけ真に評価する"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:24
msgid ""
"`IndividualBasedStrategy` selects by fraction of individuals, while "
"`PreSelectionStrategy` selects by count of individuals. "
"`GenerationBasedStrategy` switches between surrogate and true evaluation "
"by generation, not by individual. `DirectStrategy` is the comparison "
"baseline that uses no surrogate at all, with `requires_surrogate=False`."
msgstr ""
"`IndividualBasedStrategy`は個体の割合、`PreSelectionStrategy`は個体の件数で選抜する点が異なります。"
" `GenerationBasedStrategy`は個体単位ではなく世代単位でサロゲートと真の評価を切り替えます。 "
"`DirectStrategy`はサロゲートを一切使わない比較対象で、`requires_surrogate=False`です。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:28
msgid ""
"For steady-state execution, combine `DirectStrategy` with an "
"`AsyncEvaluationScheduler`. The scheduler fills available worker slots, "
"polls without blocking, and commits each completed update in the "
"lifecycle order."
msgstr "定常状態実行では、`DirectStrategy`と`AsyncEvaluationScheduler`を組み合わせます。スケジューラは利用可能なワーカースロットを埋め、ブロックせずにポーリングし、完了した更新をライフサイクル順にコミットします。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:32
msgid "Each Strategy's pipeline structure"
msgstr "各Strategyのパイプライン構成"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "Pipeline"
msgstr "パイプライン"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid "CountGeneration → Ask → TrueEvaluation → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr "CountGeneration → Ask → TrueEvaluation → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"CountGeneration → Ask → SurrogatePredictStage → AcquisitionStage → "
"SortByScore → TrueEvaluation (ratio-based) → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"CountGeneration → Ask → SurrogatePredictStage → AcquisitionStage → "
"SortByScore → TrueEvaluation（比率指定）→ ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"CountGeneration → Ask (n_candidates) → SurrogatePredictStage → "
"AcquisitionStage → TopKSelection(k=n_select) → TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"CountGeneration → Ask（n_candidates）→ SurrogatePredictStage → "
"AcquisitionStage → TopKSelection（k=n_select）→ TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../components/strategies.md
msgid ""
"SurrogateOnlyLoop (gen_ctrl times) → CountGeneration → Ask → "
"TrueEvaluation → ArchiveUpdate → Tell"
msgstr ""
"SurrogateOnlyLoop(gen_ctrl回) → CountGeneration → Ask → TrueEvaluation → "
"ArchiveUpdate → Tell"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:41
msgid ""
"See [Stage](stage.md) for the contract each individual stage satisfies. "
"See [Components overview](index.md) for the overall pipeline diagram."
msgstr ""
"各[Stage](stage.md)単体の契約は、そちらのページを参照してください。 "
"全体のパイプライン図は[コンポーネント概要](index.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:44
msgid "Which Strategy to choose"
msgstr "どのStrategyを選ぶか"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:46
msgid ""
"For problems where evaluation cost is extremely high, "
"`IndividualBasedStrategy` or `PreSelectionStrategy`, which use the "
"surrogate to filter out most candidates, are effective. Early in the "
"search, when the surrogate's reliability is still low, or when you don't "
"want to pay the surrogate's own training cost frequently, "
"`GenerationBasedStrategy`, which advances multiple generations at once "
"using only the surrogate, is suited. For problems where the surrogate's "
"approximation error itself is unacceptable, or evaluation cost is "
"sufficiently low, relying solely on true evaluation via `DirectStrategy` "
"is reasonable."
msgstr ""
"評価コストが極めて高い問題では、サロゲートで大半の候補を足切りする`IndividualBasedStrategy`や`PreSelectionStrategy`が有効です。"
" "
"サロゲートの信頼度がまだ低い探索初期や、サロゲートの学習コスト自体を頻繁に払いたくない場合は、複数世代をまとめてサロゲートのみで進める`GenerationBasedStrategy`が適しています。"
" "
"サロゲートの近似誤差そのものが許容できない、あるいは評価コストが十分低い問題では、`DirectStrategy`で真の評価だけに頼るのが妥当です。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:50
msgid "Behavior of runtime swapping"
msgstr "実行時差し替えの挙動"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:52
msgid ""
"Every Strategy's `step()` builds the current pipeline from `provider` "
"before running it. Because the pipeline isn't cached, swapping "
"`provider.algorithm` or `provider.surrogate_manager` mid-run is reliably "
"reflected from the next generation onward."
msgstr "各Strategyの`step()`は、実行前に`provider`から現在のパイプラインを構築します。パイプラインはキャッシュされないため、実行途中で`provider.algorithm`または`provider.surrogate_manager`を差し替えると、次の世代から確実に反映されます。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:55
msgid "Implementing a custom Strategy"
msgstr "独自Strategyの実装方法"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:57
msgid "If you need a custom candidate-selection scheme, there are two approaches."
msgstr "独自の候補選抜方式が必要な場合、2つのアプローチがあります。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:59
msgid ""
"**Subclass `OptimizationStrategy` directly**: Implement "
"`build_pipeline()`. This is also the form you'd use when building a new "
"pipeline by combining [Pipeline/Stage](extension_guidelines.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`OptimizationStrategy`を直接継承する**：`build_pipeline()`を実装します。 "
"[Pipeline/Stage](extension_guidelines.md)を組み合わせて新しいパイプラインを構築する場合も、この形になります。"

#: ../../components/strategies.md:104
msgid ""
"If you just want to fine-tune an existing strategy's pipeline, it's "
"lighter-weight to swap out only part of the built-in pipeline via "
"[Pipeline.replace/find](extension_guidelines.md), rather than writing a "
"new `OptimizationStrategy`."
msgstr "既存戦略のパイプラインを微調整したいだけであれば、`OptimizationStrategy`を新しく書くのではなく、[Pipeline.replace/find](extension_guidelines.md)で組み込みパイプラインの一部だけを差し替えるほうが軽量です。"

